  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells carry with them a shroud of clinging darkness.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Umbral Spell<sup>ISM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The target creature or object radiates deeper darkness in a 20-foot radius (5-foot radius if the companion spell is a 0-level spell). Alternatively, you may expend one use of mythic power to cast a spell as an umbral spell (gaining only the normal benefits of an umbral spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as umbral in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
